  "label": "Objectification/Body Part Focus",
  "description": "The stereotype that women are valued primarily for their physical appearance or body parts, often reducing them to sexual objects. This is indirectly referenced in the meme through the focus on the woman's body (implied by the text 'i'm pregnant!!') and the visual framing of her interaction with the goat, which could be interpreted as a distraction from her actual identity.",
